OL,3,GNEWSALGR director on #120k to stay
OL,4,Aafter plans shelved
OL,5,
OL,6,FA director on a six-figure salary who
OL,7,Fwas appointed to oversee plans to
OL,8,Freorganise local government in
OL,9,FWorcestershire has started work despite
OL,10,Fthe government's decision to pause the
OL,11,Fprogramme.
OL,13,FIan Benson took up the role of
OL,14,FWorcestershire local government
OL,15,Freorganisation (LGR) director at the
OL,16,Fend of August, Worcestershire County
OL,17,FCouncil confirmed.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
