OL,3,GNEWSALGR director on #120k to stay
OL,4,Aafter plans shelved
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe authority said the position, which
OL,7,Fcarries a salary of up to #120,000 a
OL,8,Fyear, was funded by all seven councils
OL,9,Fin Worcestershire using government
OL,10,Fgrant funding.
OL,12,FThe appointment comes after Local
OL,13,FGovernment Secretary Angela Rayner told
OL,14,FMPs the government would put the shake
OL,15,Fup on hold following new legal advice.
